WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.710
Happy Healthy
Go Go
Festival

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.790
A dead body?!

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.960
N-no way...

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.080
Hello?

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.500
You're... kinda cute.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.500
What?

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.000
A bunny...?

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.960
I think someone snuck in here!

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.630
Huh? Say again?

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.840
Oh, let me help you.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.500
Thanks.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.960
Special Stage
- Shout Poetry Recital
Festival Sale!
Booths
- 5-Person Female Sanshin Troupe
- Kitazawa Butcher
- Tomoe-chan on the Taiko Drums
- Yamabuki Bakery
- Musical Performance by Afterglow!
- Tayama Gemstones

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.670
A festival out by the shops?

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.130
Happy Healthy
Go Go
Festival

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.000
A musical performance?

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:55.380
All right, I'd like to get things started.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:59.460
Reserved for market street
youth group

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:59.460
My name is Tsugumi Hazawa from Hazawa Coffee,

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:03.790
chief of the festival volunteer committee
of the market street youth group.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.210
I'll start by taking attendance.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.400
Saaya-chan from Yamabuki Bakery?

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:09.290
Here!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.750
Hagumi-chan from Kitazawa Butcher?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.040
Yum!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.630
Tomoe-chan, leader of the youth group
taiko drummers, and younger sister, Ako-chan?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:21.380
I'd like a pitch black, uh...

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.750
sweet and fizzy...

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.540
Refill on your soda, right?

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.020
Oh, me too.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.290
What are you doing here, anyway?

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:33.670
Moca-chan appears wherever 
there's a good market.

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:36.750
Since she's a regular at Yamabuki Bakery now,

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:41.540
we've invited Rokka-chan from Asahi Bathhouse
to join as our newest member!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.960
I'm here representing Galaxy today.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.630
Nice to meet you all!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:53.630
My manager asked me to come by,
but I'm not really sure how I can help...

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:58.250
It's okay! We're still 
not too sure ourselves.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.670
You know, there's actually a big event
happening soon on the market street.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.830
I know! I saw the poster!

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.590
The Happy Healthy Go Go Festival, right?

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.920
The Go Fit Fest.

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:13.100
A while back, the old ladies from
the market street called me in to chat...

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:19.130
We'd like to bring in more young people
to help revive the market street.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.420
H-huh?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.710
Will you do that love thing, Tsugumi-chan?

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:24.710
The love thing.

00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:25.710
Love?

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:28.290
That thing you do with Tomoe-chan and them.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.890
The music recital.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.250
A LIVE show?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.880
They're so nostalgic, aren't they, Yone-chan?

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.000
We used to wear our school 
uniforms, didn't we?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.260
For our shamisen recitals.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.130
High school was the best!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.540
Those were the days.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.710
The best!

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.750
And that's how Afterglow's
live performance came about.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.710
Everyone from the market's 
agreed to help out.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:59.080
That's nice of them.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.080
What about Hello Happy?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.380
We're gonna do a croquette concert.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.080
A croquette concert?

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.960
Are PoPiPa performing too?

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:06.630
Hm?

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.420
Oh, you totally should!

00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:10.500
The more the merrier, right?

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.580
Could you ask the girls about it?

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:16.610
I'm pretty sure I know 
what the answer will be...

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.710
Yes! Let's do it!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.000
I thought you'd say that.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.250
But what about our self-sponsored show?

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:25.500
I'm making a list of venues right now.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.830
That was me!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.010
That festival happens every year, doesn't it.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:33.580
Yep. We sell our pastries at a booth,
and Hagumi's family do their croquettes.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.540
I love those! Only 86 yen with tax!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.580
What about the stage?

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.670
They said they're building one outside.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.420
An outdoor stage?

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.420
Sounds so nice! An outdoor stage...

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.790
You said that already.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.670
'Cause it's important...

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.040
An outdoor stage...

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.080
Three times?!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.170
It's really important.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.450
All right, I'll tell them we're in.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.790
A live show with Afterglow, huh.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.500
We'll have to choose a set list.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.170
And practice.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.960
Let's a practice a bunch! Together!

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.220
Tomoe, you're a little too fast.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.750
I'm just too excited about Go Fest!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.330
You've always loved 
festivals, huh, Tomoe-chan.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.170
What about your taiko drum performance?

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:22.540
I'll give that everything 
I've got as well! What else?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.000
You can do it, Tomo-chin!

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:29.130
We'd better get going.
Yamabuki Bakery'll be closing soon.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:33.630
A life without pastries would be...

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:36.170
no life at all...

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:37.670
Let's head home.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.750
Yum!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:44.130
I hear this is where they're 
building the stage.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:50.420
The old ladies from the market
are really looking forward to it.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:53.760
Oh, they were making some 
kind of fan decorations.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.720
Our clever tomboys
Good luck at your music recital
Happy Healthy Go Go Festival!

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.750
I'm so hyped for the festival!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.000
Me too!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.630
It's almost here.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:02.630
Let's do our best, girls!

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:07.460
C'mon! Hip, hip, hooray!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:12.420
Hey! I thought you were 
gonna do it with me, Tomoe!

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.750
You're so mean!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.420
Just like always.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.830
Hi-chan's Himarific as ever.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.830
Break time!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.830
Snack time!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:28.840
Ready?

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.040
This one!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.750
Nothing beats a good chocolate cornet.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.210
Plus, Yamabuki Bakery is local.

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:40.560
I mean, why not just write some lyrics
about the shop and make it like a commercial?

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.460
If you want to buy some bread...

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.290
Yamabuki Bakery.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.400
I wouldn't buy that.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.580
We should do something upbeat
since it's a festival and all.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.380
What about Happy Happy Party?

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.040
That one's so fun!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:04.630
Set List Ideas
1. Hey-day Capriccio
2. Tsunagu, Soramoyou

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.580
I'm thinking something like this.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.380
Ooh, I love it.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.210
Sorry I'm late!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.460
Um, Galaxy is gonna let 
us borrow their equipment,

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:14.420
so we'll need to go and
pick everything up the day before.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.220
Oh, what am I forgetting...?

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.670
She's extra Tsugurific today, huh.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:19.710
Oh yeah.

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:24.690
Well, I have to prepare for the festival,
and I wanna do tons and tons more practice...

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:28.330
Just be careful you don't overdo it
and make yourself faint again, okay?

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:31.420
Right. I'll do my best not to faint!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.290
Oh, wait...

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:35.080
She's being Tsugurific again.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.630
Just like always.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:38.080
You guys!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.210
The sunset's so pretty.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:58.950
Do you remember watching the sunset after our
middle school culture festival performance?

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.890
How could I forget?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.640
That was the first time we ever played live.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:07.880
The five of us have seen a lot of sunsets
together since then, haven't we.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.540
- Musical Performance by Afterglow!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:20.420
- Musical Performance by Afterglow!
Plus, this just in!
Live Performance!!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.540
Hey, isn't that Lock?

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.080
Lock!

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.420
Plus, this just in!
Live Performance!!
Gt. & Vo. Kasumi Toyama, Gt. Tae Hanazono,
Ba. Rimi Ushigome, Dr. Saaya Yamabuki, and
Key. Arisa Ichigaya for this adorable, fun-loving band!
They're super-duper cute!!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.420
Hey.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.460
"This just in, Poppin' 
Party live performance."

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.550
Get it off me.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.540
Have you been posting those for us?

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.670
Thanks, Lock!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.460
Here we are.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:43.670
Thanks!

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.790
What a show!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.250
Hey, it's us.

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.170
From our show a while back.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.500
Poppin' Party are performing live!

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.880
Lock must have made this for us.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.920
Hello,
Happy World!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.290
I'd love to play here again someday.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.290
Yeah.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.800
This is the last one.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.040
Let's carry them to the stage.

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.420
Yep! The produce shop said 
we can use their truck.

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:27.210
Phew! All done.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:29.000
I'm excited for tomorrow.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.330
Let's get the crowd super pumped up!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:32.330
Happy Healthy Go Go Festival

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.080
Yeah!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:43.630
Come rain or shine, we proudly present
the 15th annual Happy Healthy Go Go Festival.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:43.630
Happy Healthy
Go Go
Festival

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:46.830
Let the festivities begin!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.000
Croquette concert time!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.710
I'll take twenty!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.420
This is the Go Go festival, 
so that'll be 500 yen!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:58.550
Note: The Japanese word for 
"five" sounds like "go."

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.080
Go, go!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.510
We're Afterglow!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.470
For our first song, we-

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.380
It's raining!

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:13.920
Not the rain!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.960
Oh no! The equipment!

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:19.630
We'll have to get this 
equipment back to Galaxy.

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:20.790
I think so.

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.080
Let's help!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.420
I'll go and ask for the truck!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:30.410
Festival

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:30.920
The live performances scheduled to
take place on the main festival stage

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:34.380
Candy Apples
Corn on the Cob

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:34.380
have been suspended due 
to the rain. I repeat...

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.840
Here, feel free to use these.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.290
Thanks.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.300
These are from Hazawa Coffee, aren't they!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.630
I hope it stops soon...

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:43.750
Well, the forecast says that it should
clear up towards the evening.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:44.750
Thank you.
Well, the forecast says that it should
clear up towards the evening.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:47.790
Well, the forecast says that it should
clear up towards the evening.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:52.900
Ugh, even my shoes are soaked. 
This totally sucks...

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.250
I want to perform...

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.790
Want some?

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.130
Ako bought some snacks!

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.630
Oh, me too!

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.630
Some snacks from me!

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:06.460
Oh, Yamabuki Bakery!

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:08.630
Don't mind if I do!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.540
Thank you!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.460
Chocolate cornets!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:16.130
So, have you guys performed on
an outdoor stage before, Tsugu?

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.290
What? No, not at all!

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.000
You guys just seem so calm.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.470
All we can do right now is wait, right?

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.540
We'll perform just like always,
no matter what happens.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:30.350
How did you guys end up 
forming Afterglow together?

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:36.830
We've kind of always been 
together in a way...

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.480
We all grew up together.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.880
We were in the same classes
all through elementary school,

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:46.370
up until Ran got put into a different one
in year 2 of middle school.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.250
Class A                                    
Class B                                   Class C

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:51.080
After that, it got harder for all of us
to hang out together.

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:54.080
A band...

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.830
We should start a band!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.500
Where'd that come from?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.040
Well, I've been thinking about how to get
the five of us together more often.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:03.550
If we all start doing the same hobby,

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:07.050
we should be able to spend more 
time with each other, right?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.760
Yeah. That could work.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:14.630
It's been a while since I've seen
that look on your face, Ran!

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:15.920
Uh-huh.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.750
Did you think of something?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.170
How about this?

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.570
"Omnis"... It means "everything."

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:27.210
It sounds cool, but I'm not 
sure if it really fits...

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.830
Ultra-violet!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.000
What does that mean?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.460
It's like UV rays...

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.540
I feel like we should pick a name
that actually means something, you guys.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:42.960
True... It would be a little weird telling people
our band name means UV rays.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:46.080
What's a name that really fits us?

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.130
How about sunset?

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:48.890
Huh?

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:53.750
We always practice after school,
right when the sun's setting, right?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.890
True...

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.920
How do you say it in English?

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.250
Sunset?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.380
Evening?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:05.250
Afterglow.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.890
What do you think of Afterglow?

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.420
I love it!

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:12.540
That's that, then!

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:15.540
Our band name is gonna be Afterglow!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.250
So you guys have always been together?

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:24.130
Well, more like stuck together, I guess.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.960
We've been through a lot.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.040
Sure have...

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:28.460
Sure have.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.790
We sure have.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.000
I guess.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:36.960
And we've got big goals together, huh...

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.420
Wait, don't...

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:39.600
What? What?

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.520
W-we're shooting for Budokan!

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:47.420
Budokan, huh?

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.210
Something like that.

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:54.240
We're honestly happy just as long
as we're able to keep being ourselves, though.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.460
That's really... beautiful.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.330
You guys have such a strong bond together.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.000
You flatter us.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.790
The rain's calming down!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.000
You're right!

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:10.630
Look, it stopped! Think we can perform now?

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:14.290
If we all help with setup,
I think we might just barely make it!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.630
But, the stage...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.170
I think I saw a mop somewhere.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:22.630
Yeah, there's one in the market storage.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:25.460
We'll go and get the equipment, okay?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.080
What? But we can't use the truck anymore.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.170
We can do it!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.750
Whaat?!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.210
No way, no way, no way!

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:34.500
So heavy...

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.250
Wait! We need to lift together!

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:38.880
Let me help!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.120
Lock?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.380
Lock! That's dangerous!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.630
Lock?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.540
Lock-chan!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.050
That didn't work...

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.540
I told you not to do it...

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:54.500
Haha!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:55.640
Tomoe!
Haha!

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.330
We're here!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.920
Welcome back...

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.460
Can we carry it up?

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.580
I can help!

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.000
Are you guys performing?

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.360
Sure are!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:09.000
Uh, the love will begin on the stage soon...

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.750
Yone-san! It's actually "live."

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:13.960
Huh? The live will now begin.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:17.000
Come and watch, everyone!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:22.290
Yukina!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.210
What are we gonna do about our costumes?

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.920
They're soaking wet.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.960
We're here...

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.220
Wish us luck!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.540
They're in uniforms.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.250
Good luck.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.290
It cleared up.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.130
Maybe my good luck charm worked.

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:46.330
I brought one too.

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:48.290
Me too!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.710
So sappy...

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.630
Right. Let's do it just like always.

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.540
I'm so hyped to get out there now!

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:57.710
Not again...

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:01.160
C'mon, everybody! Let's have fun! Ready?

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.630
Hip, hip, hooray!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.710
What?! You still won't do it with me
even when the moment's perfect?!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.130
Like I said, just like always.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.580
She's so cool...

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:50.130
Man, they're good.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:53.710
If this is their "just like always,"
those five must have been through a lot.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.380
Thanks, everybody!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:07.630
PoPiPa!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.870
You're up!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:10.790
All right!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.880
Be right back, Lock!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:15.880
Okay!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.170
Thanks, Lock-chan.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:19.080
Huh?

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.330
Thank you!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:20.210
Everyone, we've got a Poppin' Party
announcement for you all.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:29.380
We'll be performing our self-sponsored show
at Galaxy, right here in the market!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.080
You heard it!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.000
H-how did I not know that??

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.460
We haven't told anyone.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.250
We wanted to surprise you.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.710
Well, it definitely worked!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.790
Thank you!

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:51.080
The North Star!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:03.710
Yay! Tomoe, you look so cool!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:05.420
This is so much fun!
Yay! Tomoe, you look so cool!

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:45.040
So they're shooting for Budokan, huh.

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:48.960
Feels kinda nice to have
the same goal as someone else.

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:53.170
We each have our own dreams.

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:54.830
Yeah.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:22:55.920
Mhm.

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:58.580
Next stop, our self-sponsored show at Galaxy!

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:06.670
See you later!

00:23:09.420 --> 00:23:11.170
Say cheese!

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:12.460
Yay!

00:23:12.460 --> 00:23:14.330
Did you take it, Rimi-rin?

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:15.540
Let's squish a little closer.

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:16.540
Come this way.

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:19.960
If we don't squish we're not all gonna fit!

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:22.960
Come here, come here!

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.460
Hana-chan?

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:38.100
Next episode: I Won't Cry, I Won't Cry
